{
  "label": "firsttimebar",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label firsttimebar:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar1.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I decide to close out the night with a trip to the bar.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’ve yet to have a drink since the whole reincarnation thing, and I’m sure Ami won’t mind if I stay out a little late every once in a while.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Look at me, thinking some teenage girl has some amount of influence over my behavior.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I must be getting soft.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The bar looks decently upscale for the area it’s in, but there aren’t any customers apart from a few old women smoking cigarettes in the corner.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I walk past them and take a seat at the bar, not noticing until now that the bartender looks exceedingly familiar...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar2.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Sana?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": H...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I had no idea you worked at a bar.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar3.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...know it’s against the rules...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar4.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Am I...going to get in trouble?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": With me? No. I’m not here to tell you how to live your life.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just try and keep it a secret from anyone more important than me and I'm sure you'll be fine.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar5.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You...really mean that?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because...when you walked in, I-",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean it. I am a little surprised you work somewhere like this, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar6.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How come?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You just...don’t really seem like the bartender type, I guess?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is the...bartender type?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably someone old enough to legally drink. But I'm sure you hear enough of that from your customers.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar7.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Umm...not really...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Most of the people who come here have been coming here for years...so I've known them for a really long time...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How long have you been working here, exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I haven't been...working here for long...but my mom lives upstairs, so...I...kind of grew up here...or something.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You live above a bar? That's amazing.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...I live in the dorms now, so...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shame. Though, I guess that probably helps with you not becoming an alcoholic at an early age. Not that I imagine you drink much to begin with.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": R-Right...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana doesn’t seem much different than she does in class. She’s still just as quiet as ever.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well- scratch that. She does seem different. But only in the fact that she is significantly more adorable in her work clothes than she is in her school uniform.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which is a weird thing to admit since my attraction to school girls has been slapping me across the face ever since waking up.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Either way, I am now obligated to test the waters and compliment her appearance because that is just the type of guy I am.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Those clothes fit you well, Sana.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...sorry...Thank you...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's just...they were my brother’s.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Were? Does he not work here anymore?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar8.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's not...really something I want to talk about right now...if that's okay...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar9.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's fine. I'm not going to push you out of your comfort zone until the second or third time we hang out after class...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...don't think that's...a thing we should do...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That aside, do you think you could pour me a drink? That's kind of the whole reason I'm here, after all.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar5.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You drink, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What other reason would I have to come to a bar?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar7.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...yeah...hahah...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": R-Right...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar9r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar9r.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar9r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, what can I get for you then?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just a beer, thanks. I'm not really a liquor person.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar10.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay...Coming right up.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbarnone",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbarnone.webp",
      "alt": "firstbarnone"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana moves to the opposite end of the bar and opens up a cooler that must be at least twenty years old.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She pushes aside a few half-empty syrup bottles and grabs me a can of some beer I don't recognize.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar10.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...here you go...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is this exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's...umm...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You...did say you wanted a beer...right?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I just don't recognize this kind.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar7.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We...only carry alcohol from the local brewery, so...I'm sorry if it's not to your liking...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s a brewery in Kumon-mi?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar10.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If there wasn't...we'd have a problem...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well hey, beer is beer and I got what I asked for.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana pulls the tab of the can open and slides it over to me as if she's doing it from muscle memory but, well, I guess that's to be expected given the environment she's apparently grown up in.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Assuming she's not done growing up, that is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s still strange seeing someone so [young]doing a job like this, though.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So how long has your family been running this place, exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar7.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Since...way before I was born...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My grandma and grandpa opened the bar a long time ago...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar10.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My...mom told me it used to be really popular when she was a little girl...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar11.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...now, it's...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana's eyes navigate to the corner of the room, where the group of old women sit.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now that she's redirected her attention over there, I become acutely aware that they've been mysteriously quiet ever since I showed up.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "They're old, though. They probably just ran out of energy or something. That seems like an old-person thing to do.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So I guess this place is pretty much the shell of its former self then?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's a...good way to describe it...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar12.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don't...think it's because of me...do you?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, I’ve only been here once, so I can’t say for sure...but I highly doubt that’s it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If anything, I’d think having a bartender as cute as you would reel even more customers in.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar3.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...uhh...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You could probably work on your social skills a bit, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar2.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What I mean is that I know you’re naturally this quiet, but newer customers might not get that right away.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar7.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was...kind of worried that might be the case...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar9.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei...do you know any tricks to...you know...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Get better at having conversations with strangers?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar3.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Y-Yeah...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm...Not really.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar12r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar12r.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar12r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I see...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s just something you sort of have to do if you ever want to make it through life.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Look at me- I don’t like talking to strangers 99%% of the time, but I still do it because that’s just how life works.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can’t just avoid everything forever. If life were that simple, we wouldn’t need jobs or[school] or anything like that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar7.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...guess you’re right.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You seem to be talking to me just fine, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar9r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar9r.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar9r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...I’ve talked to you before, so...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe we just need to talk a little more, then?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar2.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Talk...more?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": By opening up more to me, you might get better at opening up to others. Right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar7.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...I don’t really know about that...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That settles it, then.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar4.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, settles what?...I'm...suddenly confused...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m going to help teach you some social skills whenever I drop by the bar.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It's not like I plan on teaching her anything in school, so this is just my way to make up for that.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar7.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei, I...don’t really have time for extra classes...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it really an extra class if you're on the clock for it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that...really okay, though?...Isn’t this place...a little far from your home?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not that bad. Plus, if it’s for you, I don’t mind at all.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar4.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You really mean that?...You’ll go out of your way for me?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course. You’re one of my students. Plus, it will give you an incentive to reward me with free drinks and that is always a plus.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar13.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heheh...well...we'll...have to see about that part...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because...I don't really think we're in the position right now to...be able to do that...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, lucky for you, I'm paying tonight.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I chug the remainder of my beer and slide the can back to Sana.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's...not exactly lucky for me...That's just...kind of how...buying things works...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then you're lucky I decided to stop by here instead of some other bar.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar10.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heheh...that, I...can't argue with...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you ready for another?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m fine for tonight, actually. I think I’m going to head out.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar9.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": O-Oh...I see...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll be back soon, though. Just keep trying to improve on your own in the meantime.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar3.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll try but...I’m pretty bad...I can't really promise that...there will be any progress...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I'm passable. So I'm sure everything will all work out in the long run.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firstbar10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firstbar10.webp",
      "alt": "firstbar10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay...I trust you...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Goodnight, Sensei...I’ll see you soon.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm sure you will.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Goodnight, Sana.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
