    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I take a handful of coins out of my pocket and leave them on the counter without ever asking for a bill.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I'm sure it's a lot more than necessary, but it's not like I have anything I'm saving up for. And spending that money on Sana might be a good tool to get her to open up to me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is that technically a form of bribery? Sure. I guess you could say that.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But if there's anyone bribery works on, it's a family in financial turmoil.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I start my journey home with slightly lighter pockets, but a slightly more optimistic outlook for the future.",
      "zh": ""
    },
